<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-JAPAN BEAT CROATIA IN KIRIN CUP OPENER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAPAN BEAT CROATIA IN KIRIN CUP OPENER.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the opening match in the</p>
<p>three-nation Kirin Cup soccer tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Japan 4 Croatia 3 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 12 Croatia v Turkey,</p>
<p>June 15 Japan v Turkey.</p>
</text>
